,"original_id":"aw103","type":"work","label":"The Philadelphia Story","title_display":"The Philadelphia Story","title":"The Philadelphia Story","title_original":"","work_type":"film","date_created_year":1940,"quality_tier":"basic","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKUubjvxO78XDts6VP1Ggcp4R9O.jpg","primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/dKUubjvxO78XDts6VP1Ggcp4R9O.jpg","is_phantom":true,"is_stub":false,"is_enriched":false,"hop_distance":1,"person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap309","person_name":"George Cukor","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}]},{"id":"work_aw104","original_id":"aw104","type":"work","label":"A Letter to Three Wives","title_display":"A Letter to Three Wives","title":"A Letter to Three Wives","title_original":"","work_type":"film","date_created_year":1949,"quality_tier":"basic","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSfwTLt2K8IeEeppsiDq7svikbV.jpg","primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/bSfwTLt2K8IeEeppsiDq7svikbV.jpg","is_phantom":true,"is_stub":false,"is_enriched":false,"hop_distance":1,"person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap14","person_name":"Joseph L. Mankiewicz","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}]},{"id":"work_aw102","original_id":"aw102","type":"work","label":"Stage Door","title_display":"Stage Door","title":"Stage Door","title_original":"","work_type":"film","date_created_year":1937,"quality_tier":"basic","image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4zqAKoJAtmkK71IyeWHc6spEKB.jpg","primary_image_url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/p4zqAKoJAtmkK71IyeWHc6spEKB.jpg","is_phantom":true,"is_stub":false,"is_enriched":false,"hop_distance":1,"person_roles":[{"person_id":"ap304","person_name":"Gregory La Cava","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}]}],"edges":[{"source":"work_aw36","target":"person_ap14","type":"work_person","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Writer & Director"},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"person_ap15","type":"work_person","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Margo Channing"},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"person_ap16","type":"work_person","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Eve Harrington"},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"person_ap17","type":"work_person","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Addison DeWitt"},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"person_ap18","type":"work_person","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Miss Casswell"},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw105","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"Often viewed as a camp reinterpretation of 'All About Eve,' the film follows a ruthless newcomer who claws her way to the top of the Las Vegas showgirl hierarchy, mirroring Eve's trajectory in a far more lurid and explicit manner."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw66","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"Cassavetes' film explores similar themes of an aging stage actress facing a professional and personal crisis, echoing Margo Channing's anxieties about her career and identity."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw67","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"The psychological thriller translates the 'All About Eve' dynamic of a veteran performer and an ambitious, duplicitous understudy to the competitive world of professional ballet."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw68","type":"work_work","relation_type":"influenced","relation_note":"The film mirrors the mentor-protégé relationship turning into a rivalry, with a naive but ambitious young woman learning from and eventually challenging a powerful, established figure in a glamorous industry."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw65","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"Released the same year, both films offer a cynical, darkly witty critique of show business and the perils of aging within it, featuring iconic performances by legendary actresses of a previous era."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw64","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"This earlier film established the popular narrative of an established star being supplanted by a rising newcomer, a central theme echoed and expanded upon in All About Eve."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw103","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"While a romantic comedy, its sophisticated, rapid-fire dialogue and sharp social satire, written by Donald Ogden Stewart from Philip Barry's play, provided a model for the verbally dexterous and witty screenplay Mankiewicz crafted."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw104","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"Mankiewicz refined his use of multiple-perspective narration and flashback in this earlier film, a structural device he perfected in 'All About Eve' to reveal the characters' complex motivations and differing perceptions of Eve."},{"source":"work_aw36","target":"work_aw102","type":"work_work","relation_type":"inspired_by","relation_note":"This film, about a group of aspiring actresses living in a theatrical boarding house, established a template for backstage dramas focused on female competition and camaraderie that 'All About Eve' masterfully built upon."},{"source":"person_ap14","target":"work_aw104","type":"person_work","role_type":"director","role_detail":"Director"}],"stats":{"total_nodes":15,"total_edges":15,"hop_0_count":1,"hop_1_count":14,"hop_2_count":0,"hop_3_count":0,"phantom_count":15,"vault_count":0}}